    <string name="message_source_non_free_network_content">Tseqdac-ed lqem n Freenet n usnas, i yessefrak kan isɣunen yettwasɣeren ɣef uẓeṭṭa ilelli. Akken ad tkemmleḍ aseqdec n uɣbalu-a, uɣal ɣer lqem Standard. Neɣ, fren aɣbalu nniḍen.</string>
    <string name="widget_custom_subtitle_explanation">Tzemreḍ ad tessekcamḍ kra i k-yeɛǧben, maca ḥader ɣef teɣzi n tefrit. Ma tebɣiḍ ad d-tawiḍ isallen n tegnit, ma ulac akken, seqdec $ i ussekteɣ ɣef wawal n telɣut.\n\nAmedya, “Current weather is: $cw$.” ad d-yeffeɣ s talɣa n “Current weather is: Clear sky.”.</string>
