    <string name="settings_background_updates_refresh_never_warning2">Akala n usnefli n tfelwit d afessas: yessefray kan amḍiq amezwaru s lqidar n tfernitik, d imukan usligen kan ma yella teḥwaǧeḍ-ten, yiwet n tikkelt deg wass. Yettwaxdam s tbatrit yerna ur yessefk ara ad yezger %d MB n tmeẓla n yisefka deg wayyur.</string>
    <string name="settings_background_updates_refresh_never_warning3">Ḥessed ad tesqedceḍ azal n usnefli ur nesɛi ara aṭas n tɣawsiwin deg umkan n usfeḍ n tɣawsiwin n tfelwit, ma ulac, ṭṭef “Kemmel” ma mazal tebɣiḍ ad tkemleḍ.</string>
